SUMMARY:Social plus Brainstorming Future Meetups - R-Ladies PDX
DESCRIPTION:Let's get together, make some friends, and brainstorm ideas for what we want to see at future meetups! I'll bring nametags, index cards, post-its and sharpies. Bring a pen and some ideas!\n\nThis is also the first day of posit::conf - if you're doing the workshops, bring that energy and share what you've learned! Discuss with others about what talks you're most excited to see.\n\nTentatively, I'd like to meet at least every 2 months, and maybe find a regular day that works for a lot of people to plan around.
LOCATION:Honey latte cafe, 1033 SE Main St, Portland, OR 97214, United States,, Portland, UNITED STATES OF AMERICA
URL:https://www.meetup.com/rladies-pdx/events/316026203/
